<p>Decimal 36877. Raw name for this VIC chip register. Also known as <strong>SOUNDFX_REGISTER</strong>, where the full description lives.</p>
<p>Sound oscillator 4, the noise voice.</p>
<ul>
<li>Bit 7 - switches the voice on or off</li>
<li>Bits 6-0 - pitch of the noise, from a deep rumble to a bright hiss</li>
</ul>
